{"term":{"label":"愛","occurrences":5,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"1A","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-i","title":"梁惠王上","description":"孟子見梁惠王。王曰：「叟不遠千里而來，亦將有以利吾國乎？」\n孟子對曰：「王何必曰利？亦有仁義而已矣。王曰『何以利吾國』？大夫曰『何以利吾家』？士庶人曰『何以利吾身』？上下交征利而國危矣。萬乘之國弒其君者，必千乘之家；千乘之國弒其君者，必百乘之家。萬取千焉，千取百焉，不為不多矣。苟為後義而先利，不奪不饜。未有仁而遺其親者"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"一","id":"一"},{"form":"事","id":"事"},{"form":"何","id":"何"},{"form":"國","id":"國"},{"form":"姓","id":"姓"},{"form":"孰","id":"孰"},{"form":"愛","id":"愛"},{"form":"易","id":"易"},{"form":"楚","id":"楚"},{"form":"牛","id":"牛"},{"form":"王","id":"王"},{"form":"異","id":"異"},{"form":"百","id":"百"},{"form":"羊","id":"羊"},{"form":"聞","id":"聞"},{"form":"齊","id":"齊"}],"edges":[{"weight":0.12036368224987509,"source":"齊","target":"王"},{"weight":2.495269436823547,"source":"齊","target":"事"},{"weight":2.272125885509337,"source":"齊","target":"聞"},{"weight":2.782951509275328,"source":"齊","target":"一"},{"weight":0.9371248187769972,"source":"齊","target":"何"},{"weight":1.483668525145067,"source":"齊","target":"國"},{"weight":2.272125885509337,"source":"齊","target":"愛"},{"weight":2.272125885509337,"source":"齊","target":"牛"},{"weight":3.370738174177447,"source":"易","target":"羊"},{"weight":2.272125885509337,"source":"易","target":"愛"},{"weight":3.188416617383492,"source":"楚","target":"孰"},{"weight":0.12036368224987509,"source":"楚","target":"王"},{"weight":0.9371248187769972,"source":"楚","target":"何"},{"weight":2.495269436823547,"source":"楚","target":"異"},{"weight":0.7139812674627873,"source":"羊","target":"何"},{"weight":2.7421295147550726,"source":"羊","target":"牛"},{"weight":2.048982334195127,"source":"羊","target":"愛"},{"weight":0.09737416402517637,"source":"百","target":"國"},{"weight":0.6494427463252161,"source":"百","target":"何"},{"weight":2.495269436823547,"source":"百","target":"姓"},{"weight":1.9844438130575563,"source":"百","target":"愛"},{"weight":1.1089750757036563,"source":"百","target":"異"},{"weight":0.703509967595492,"sou